# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# PUBLIC configuration only.
#
# Anything prefixed with VITE_ is inlined into the JavaScript bundle at build
# time, which means it ships to every visitor and can be read with View Source.
# NEVER put a secret in this file.
#
# Real secrets (payment keys, AI keys, service-role keys, anything ending in a
# private credential) belong in your hosting provider's environment variable
# settings, and must only ever be read from server-side code.
#
# The Supabase publishable ("anon") key below is intentionally public. Access is
# controlled by Row Level Security policies on the database, not by hiding this
# key — so make sure RLS is enabled on every table.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

